    "htmlContent": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"tr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Doğru Sözlü Olmak - Ders Sunumu</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Merriweather:wght@300;700&family=Nunito:wght@400;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #0f172a;\n            color: #f8fafc;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Merriweather', serif; }\n\n        /* SLAYT YAPISI */\n        .slide {\n            display: none !important;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.6s ease-in-out;\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .slide.active {\n            display: flex !important;\n            opacity: 1;\n            z-index: 10;\n        }\n\n        /* CAM KARTLAR */\n        .glass-panel {\n            width: 90vw;\n            height: 85vh;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n            border-radius: 2rem;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 3rem;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n\n        /* ANİMASYONLAR */\n        .fade-up { animation: fadeUp 0.8s forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }\n        .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }\n        .delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }\n        .delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }\n\n        @keyframes fadeUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n\n        /* ARKA PLAN */\n        .bg-gradient-radial {\n            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #111827 0%, #000000 100%);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"h-screen w-screen relative bg-gradient-radial\">\n\n    <!-- Dekoratif -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[40vw] h-[40vw] bg-green-600/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Navigasyon -->\n    <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 right-8 z-50 flex gap-6\">\n        <button onclick=\"changeSlide(-1)\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center transition border border-white/20 text-2xl\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></button>\n        <span id=\"slide-num\" class=\"flex items-center font-bold text-blue-200 text-2xl w-16 justify-center\">1/8</span>\n        <button onclick=\"changeSlide(1)\" class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center transition border border-white/20 text-2xl\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 1: KAPAK -->\n    <div class=\"slide active\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel border-t-8 border-blue-500 fade-up\">\n            <div class=\"inline-block bg-blue-500/20 p-8 rounded-full mb-8\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-hand-holding-heart text-8xl text-blue-400\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-extrabold mb-6 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-200 to-white\">\n                DOĞRU SÖZLÜ OLMAK\n            </h1>\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl text-gray-400 font-light mb-8 text-center max-w-4xl\">\n                \"Doğruluk iyiliğe, iyilik de cennete götürür.\"\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10\">\n                <span class=\"text-xl text-blue-200 font-bold\">3. ÜNİTE: AHLAKİ DAVRANIŞLAR</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 2: ENDONEZYA HİKAYESİ -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel fade-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-10 text-green-200 border-b-2 border-green-500/50 pb-4\">Bir Dürüstlük Hikayesi</h2>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-12 items-center w-full max-w-7xl\">\n                <div class=\"w-1/3 text-center\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-ship text-9xl text-green-500 opacity-80\"></i>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-green-300\">Müslüman Kumaş Tüccarı</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-2/3 space-y-6 text-2xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                    <p><i class=\"fas fa-circle text-xs text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> Tüccarın çırağı, 5 akçelik kumaşı yanlışlıkla 10 akçeye sattı.</p>\n                    <p><i class=\"fas fa-circle text-xs text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> Tüccar bunu öğrenince hemen müşteriyi buldu, özür diledi ve parayı iade etti.</p>\n                    <p><i class=\"fas fa-circle text-xs text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> Bu dürüstlük Kral'ın dikkatini çekti. Kral ve halkı, İslam'ın bu güzelliği sayesinde Müslüman oldu.</p>\n                    <div class=\"bg-green-900/30 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-green-500 mt-8\">\n                        <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">Ders:</span> Söz ve davranışlardaki doğruluk, en etkili davet yöntemidir.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 3: TANIM VE ÖNEMİ -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel fade-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-12 text-blue-200\">Doğruluk Nedir?</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 w-full max-w-6xl\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-400 mb-4\">Tanım</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Söz, davranış ve niyet bakımından dürüstlük ve iyilikten yana olmaktır. İçi dışı bir olmaktır.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-4\">Önemi</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"text-xl text-gray-300 space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> Güven ortamı oluşturur.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> Dostlukları pekiştirir.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> Toplumsal huzuru sağlar.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-12 text-2xl italic text-gray-400\">\n                \"Doğruluk kalbin huzura ermesidir. Yalan ise şüpheden ibarettir.\" (Hadis-i Şerif)\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 4: YALANIN ZARARLARI -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel fade-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-10 text-red-200\">Yalan Güveni Yıkar</h2>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-8 max-w-5xl\">\n                <div class=\"bg-red-500/10 p-8 rounded-2xl border-l-8 border-red-500 w-full\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle mr-3\"></i>Bir Uyarı</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Peygamberimiz, çocuğunu \"Gel sana bir şey vereceğim\" diye çağıran anneyi uyardı:\n                        <br><br>\n                        <span class=\"text-white font-bold italic\">\"Eğer ona bir şey vermemiş olsaydın, bu senin için bir yalan olarak yazılacaktı.\"</span>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 w-full mt-6\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-xl text-center\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-user-injured text-4xl text-red-400 mb-3\"></i>\n                        <p>Güveni Zedeler</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-xl text-center\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-users-slash text-4xl text-red-400 mb-3\"></i>\n                        <p>Dostluğu Bitirir</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-xl text-center\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale-right text-4xl text-red-400 mb-3\"></i>\n                        <p>Adaleti Bozar</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 5: İLGİ ÇEKİCİ ÖRNEKLER (YENİ EKLENDİ) -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel fade-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-12 text-yellow-200 text-center\">Güven ve Yalan İlişkisi</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-12 w-full max-w-6xl\">\n                \n                <!-- Örnek 1: Buruşuk Kağıt -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition text-center group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-white/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-file-alt text-5xl text-white\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Buruşuk Kağıt Örneği</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Güven, düz bir kağıt gibidir. Bir kere yalan söyleyip buruşturursanız, ne kadar düzeltmeye çalışırsanız çalışın, üzerinde hep izler kalır.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Örnek 2: Yalancı Çoban -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white/5 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition text-center group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-24 h-24 bg-red-500/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition\">\n                        <i class=\"fas fa-bullhorn text-5xl text-red-400\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Yalancı Çoban</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Sürekli yalan söyleyen kişi, bir gün gerçekten doğruyu söylediğinde bile kimse ona inanmaz. Yalanın en büyük bedeli budur.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 6: PEYGAMBERİMİZİN ÖRNEKLİĞİ -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel fade-up border-t-8 border-yellow-500\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-12 text-yellow-200\">Muhammedü'l Emin</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center w-full max-w-6xl\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-yellow-500 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-black font-bold\">1</div>\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl text-gray-200\">Peygamberlikten önce bile \"Güvenilir\" (El-Emin) olarak anılırdı.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-yellow-500 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-black font-bold\">2</div>\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl text-gray-200\">Şaka yaparken bile asla yalan söylemezdi.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-yellow-500 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl text-black font-bold\">3</div>\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl text-gray-200\">Düşmanları bile onun dürüstlüğüne şahitti.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-black/40 p-10 rounded-3xl text-center border border-yellow-500/30\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-quote-left text-4xl text-yellow-500 mb-4 block\"></i>\n                    <p class=\"text-3xl font-serif italic text-white leading-relaxed\">\n                        \"Doğruluktan ayrılmayın. Çünkü doğruluk iyiliğe, iyilik de cennete götürür.\"\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 7: HZ. ŞUAYB KISSASI -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel fade-up\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-5xl font-bold mb-8 text-purple-200\">Hz. Şuayb ve Medyen Halkı</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"flex gap-10 w-full max-w-7xl h-full\">\n                <!-- Sol: Sorunlar -->\n                <div class=\"w-1/2 bg-red-900/20 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-red-500/30\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-300 mb-6 border-b border-red-500/30 pb-2\">Medyen'in Hataları</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-xl text-gray-300\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500\"></i> Allah'a ortak koşup putlara tapıyorlardı.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500\"></i> <strong>Ölçü ve tartıda hile</strong> yapıyorlardı.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500\"></i> İnsanların mallarını eksik veriyorlardı.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-times text-red-500\"></i> Yol kesip haydutluk yapıyorlardı.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Sağ: Uyarılar -->\n                <div class=\"w-1/2 bg-green-900/20 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-green-500/30\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-green-300 mb-6 border-b border-green-500/30 pb-2\">Hz. Şuayb'ın Mesajı</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-xl text-gray-300\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500\"></i> Allah'a iman edin.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500\"></i> <strong>Ölçüyü ve tartıyı tam yapın.</strong></li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500\"></i> İnsanların hakkını yemeyin.</li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><i class=\"fas fa-check text-green-500\"></i> Bozgunculuk yapmayın.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-gray-400 text-lg\">Sonuç: Uyarıları dinlemeyen Medyen halkı helak oldu.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- SLAYT 8: SONUÇ -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"glass-panel text-center fade-up border-t-8 border-white\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-7xl font-bold mb-8 text-white\">ÖZETLE</h1>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-left max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400 text-3xl\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl\">Doğruluk, müminin en temel özelliğidir.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400 text-3xl\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl\">Yalan söylemek, şaka bile olsa yasaktır.</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400 text-3xl\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl\">Ticarette dürüstlük bereket getirir (Hz. Şuayb).</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-6 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-4\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-400 text-3xl\"></i>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl\">Dürüstlük toplumları İslam'a ısındırır.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <button onclick=\"changeSlide(-7)\" class=\"px-12 py-5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 rounded-full font-bold transition shadow-2xl text-white text-2xl transform hover:scale-105\">\n                <i class=\"fas fa-redo mr-4\"></i> Başa Dön\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        let currentSlide = 0;\n        const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.slide');\n        const numDisplay = document.getElementById('slide-num');\n\n        function updateSlide() {\n            slides.forEach((s, i) => {\n                s.classList.remove('active');\n                if(i === currentSlide) {\n                    s.classList.add('active');\n                    const anims = s.querySelectorAll('.fade-up');\n                    anims.forEach(el => {\n                        el.style.animation = 'none';\n                        el.offsetHeight; \n                        el.style.animation = null; \n                    });\n                }\n            });\n            numDisplay.innerText = `${currentSlide + 1}/${slides.length}`;\n        }\n\n        function changeSlide(n) {\n            let next = currentSlide + n;\n            if(next >= 0 && next < slides.length) {\n                currentSlide = next;\n                updateSlide();\n            }\n        }\n\n        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n            if(e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === ' ') changeSlide(1);\n            if(e.key === 'ArrowLeft') changeSlide(-1);\n        });\n\n        updateSlide();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
